WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.100
[Techno beat] Three movies open side by side. ROB's outdoor Maker Faire drive comes forward, then sweeps right.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:16.500
ROB and the droids inside the exhibit hall fill the foreground. The screen slides left.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:23.500
The workshop screen approaches. ROB's gripper holds a red can as its chassis turns.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:28.000
The workshop movie returns to center and grows into the final view.
